# Config and content IDs

- Prefer stable lowercase namespaced ids in config (`unit.commander`, `terrain.grass`).
- Until a config loader exists, new balance values go into `MvpDefinitions.cs` — not SFML.
- Do not hardcode recipes/balance in rendering code.
- Asset paths are presentation-only and must not define gameplay rules.
- Document transitional hardcoded values in `docs/MVP_IMPLEMENTATION_DECISIONS.md` when they change product behavior.
